=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to Hieronymus
* Exit to {z:North Gustaberg (S)}, follow the wall to the east-(K8) to find the {n:Allied Ensign}.
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Ruhotz Silvermines}.
* You will come across a Soldier, who immediately runs towards a {m:Trained Bat} and begins attacking.
** During this time, you will see messages that display how much attention he is giving to the fight:
*** The soldier seems unfocused...
*** The soldier has begun to train harder!
*** The soldier is fighting with vigor!
* Once the bat defeated, the Mission Objective is complete.
** It is probably a good strategy to let the soldier tank until he is fighting with vigor, then attack the bat.
** If the soldier never gains focus, you lose the mission.
* Return and talk to Hieronymus for your reward.

=2 Notes
* There seems to be no time limit to how long you can take to get to Ruhotz Silvermines.
* The soldier will die if left alone, however can cure himself.
* The bat lasts a long while, and seems to shift hate very often.

